{
  "description": "WWI causal-chain counterfactual engine — the learner toggles structural causes and triggers off/on, a dependency cascade removes any cause whose enabling edge is gone, and the summed contribution of active causes is compared against a war threshold on a math-canvas. Standalone by default; behind a lab router set matchMode and it renders only when MODE_SELECTED matches.",
