                  "to": "outcome"
                },
                {
                  "from": "nationalism",
                  "to": "assassination-trigger"
                }
              ],
              "description": "Declared cause-to-outcome edges (every cause feeds the war outcome directly) plus one cause-to-cause dependency: nationalism enables the assassination trigger, so removing nationalism cascades to disable the trigger too.",
              "items": {
                "properties": {
